0,Amahuaca language - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Amahuaca_language,"Beginning in the 1960s, the Amahuaca began to move near Spanish-speaking mestizo communities, and gradually began to assimilate into their culture. More and more Amahuaca speakers, as a result, are becoming bilingual with Spanish.",Amahuaca,Panoan
